  "body": "A little vision, a great location and the opportunity to make it your own!\r\n\r\nLooking to get onto the property ladder, secure an investment or find a home with potential to enhance over time? This three-bedroom home on a freehold section in Gulf Harbour could be just what you've been looking for!\r\n\r\nOffering a generous 153sqm floor area, the home provides comfortable, practical living with plenty of opportunity to add your own style and value.\r\nDownstairs, enjoy an open-plan kitchen and living area, built-in laundry, guest toilet and internal-access single garage. Upstairs offers a spacious master bedroom with walk-in wardrobe, two additional bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n- Freehold section\r\n- Generous 153sqm floor area\r\n- Three bedrooms and family bathroom\r\n- Open-plan kitchen and living\r\n- Guest toilet and built-in laundry\r\n- Internal-access single garage plus additional parking\r\n- Quiet, established neighbourhood\r\n- Opportunity to refresh, enhance and add value\r\n\r\nEnjoy the Gulf Harbour lifestyle! Situated in a peaceful neighbourhood, you're close to Gulf Harbour Marina, local restaurants, shops, scenic walking trails and the beautiful beaches and natural surroundings of Shakespear Regional Park.\r\n\r\nBuilt in the 2000s, the home features predominantly brick veneer exterior cladding with a solid plaster and painted finish. Exterior maintenance and repairs are required, offering buyers an opportunity to undertake improvements over time\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, investor or someone looking for a property with potential, 30 Trimaran Drive is well worth exploring! Come along and discover the possibilities!",
